y><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-30T15:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-30T15:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">602</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Sat Timelock plug at 600 m according to Archer procedures.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-30T15:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-30T16:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">595</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Closed ball valve and pressured up string to 35 bar to verify same closed. P/U and released RT from plug.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-30T16:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-30T16:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">595</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>R/U side-entry assy and TIW valve. Performed line test with cement unit. Test ok.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-30T16:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-30T17:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">595</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Filled well with drill water above diverter packer, closed